# Mnemosyne prompt templates. Empty, and intended to stay that way.
#
# Mnemosyne consults no model. Recall is a keyed lookup on the trigger's own
# labels - see core/memory/recall.py - and a model asked to say whether two
# alerts are "the same" would be guessing at a question the labels answer.
#
# The directory exists because tests/unit/test_repo_structure.py requires every
# agent to ship one. The TODO that was here said "populate this directory", and
# a TODO that must never be actioned trains people to ignore TODOs.
#
# Phase: 5 - Proactive Flow
